                            <comment id="16128820" author="vozerov" created="Wed, 16 Aug 2017 13:49:02 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I think we should not allow DML inside ongoing TX and vice versa. This can be controlled with help of thread-locals. Otherwise user is at high risk of getting deadlocks. We will allow this stuff once MVCC and transactional SQL are ready.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16591733" author="jooger" created="Fri, 24 Aug 2018 14:21:00 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=1725151&amp;amp;tab=buildResultsDiv&amp;amp;buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_ContinuousQuery2&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;Test results&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
